    {
      "id": "P11.49",
      "explanation_id": "p1",
      "subparts": [
        "main"
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "subpart": "main",
          "label": "바이어스와 내부 이득",
          "html": "<p> $Q_1$ 전류의 75%를 $Q_3$가 공급해요. 큰 $\\beta$에서 $Q_2$의 컬렉터 전류를 이미터 전류로 근사하면 $g_m$도 전류와 같은 비로 나뉘어요.</p>$$I_{C2}\\simeq I_{C1}/4$$\n$$g_{m2}\\simeq g_{m1}/4$$\n"
        },
        {
          "subpart": "main",
          "label": "밀러 배율",
          "html": "<p> $X$에서 생긴 $Q_1$의 전류가  $Y$ 전압을 낮춰요. $V_A=\\infty$이므로 $Y$의 부하는 $Q_2$ 이미터 쪽의 약 $1/g_{m2}$예요.</p>$$A_{XY}=v_Y/v_X\\simeq-g_{m1}/g_{m2}\\simeq-4$$\n"
        },
        {
          "subpart": "main",
          "label": "밀러 분리 전후의 회로",
          "html": "<figure class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 181\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"왼쪽은 X와 Y 사이에 떠 있는 C_mu1입니다. 오른쪽은 X와 Y에 각각 접지로 연결된 밀러 커패시터입니다.\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\">\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"97\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">분리 전</text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"360\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">분리 후</text>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M24 68 H92.0 M92.0 56 V80 M102.0 56 V80 M102.0 68 H170\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"97\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\">C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">μ1</tspan></text>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"24\" cy=\"68\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p1-pa\" data-node-color=\"blue\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"24\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p1-pa\" data-node-color=\"blue\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">X</tspan></text>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"170\" cy=\"68\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p1-pb\" data-node-color=\"red\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"170\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p1-pb\" data-node-color=\"red\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">Y</tspan></text>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M190 76 H215 m-5 -5 l5 5 -5 5\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M250 68 V96\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M250 96 V106.0 M238 106.0 H262 M238 114.0 H262 M250 114.0 V124\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M250 124 V131\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M240 131 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"250\" cy=\"68\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p1-qa\" data-node-color=\"blue\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"250\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p1-qa\" data-node-color=\"blue\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">X</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"261\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">μ1</tspan></text>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M400 68 V96\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M400 96 V106.0 M388 106.0 H412 M388 114.0 H412 M400 114.0 V124\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M400 124 V131\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M390 131 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"400\" cy=\"68\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p1-qb\" data-node-color=\"red\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"400\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p1-qb\" data-node-color=\"red\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">Y</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"427\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1.25C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">μ1</tspan></text>\n</svg><figcaption>내부 이득 $A_{XY}\\simeq-4$를 적용한 밀러 분리.</figcaption></figure>"
        },
        {
          "subpart": "main",
          "label": "노드별 커패시턴스",
          "html": "<p>밀러 분리 후 $C_{\\mu1}$은 $X$에서 $(1-A_{XY})$배, $Y$에서 $(1-1/A_{XY})$배예요. 바이어스가 고정된 $Q_3$의 컬렉터 기생 성분도 $Y$에 남아요.</p>$$C_X=C_{\\pi1}+5C_{\\mu1}$$\n$$C_Y=1.25C_{\\mu1}+C_{CS1}+C_{\\pi2}+C_{\\mu3}+C_{CS3}$$\n$$C_{\\mathrm{out}}=C_{\\mu2}+C_{CS2}$$\n"
        },
        {
          "subpart": "main",
          "label": "노드별 자연응답 회로",
          "html": "<figure class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 551 125\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"입력 X, 중간 Y, 출력에서 각각 노드 저항과 접지 기준 커패시턴스가 병렬로 연결된 세 개의 자연응답 회로\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\">\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M82 37 H142\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M82 37 V55.0 l6 3 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 6 3 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M72 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M142 37 V69.0 M130 69.0 H154 M130 77.0 H154 M142 77.0 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M132 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"82\" cy=\"37\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p1-X\" data-node-color=\"blue\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"82\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p1-X\" data-node-color=\"blue\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">X</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"66\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\">R<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">B</tspan> ‖ r<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">π1</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"164\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\">C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">X</tspan></text>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M261 37 H321\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M261 37 V55.0 l6 3 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 6 3 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M251 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M321 37 V69.0 M309 69.0 H333 M309 77.0 H333 M321 77.0 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M311 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"261\" cy=\"37\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p1-Y\" data-node-color=\"red\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"261\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p1-Y\" data-node-color=\"red\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">Y</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"245\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\">1/g<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">m2</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"343\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\">C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">Y</tspan></text>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M418 37 H478\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M418 37 V55.0 l6 3 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 6 3 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M408 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M478 37 V69.0 M466 69.0 H490 M466 77.0 H490 M478 77.0 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M468 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"418\" cy=\"37\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p1-out\" data-node-color=\"blue\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"418\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p1-out\" data-node-color=\"blue\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">out</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"402\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\">R<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">C</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"500\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\">C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">out</tspan></text>\n</svg><figcaption>입력원을 영으로 둔 뒤, 각 노드의 전체 커패시턴스와 병렬로 남는 저항이에요.</figcaption></figure>"
        }
      ],
      "answers": [
        {
          "subpart": "main",
          "html": "<p>입력원을 영으로 두면 $X$에서는 $R_B\\parallel r_{\\pi1}$, 출력에서는 $R_C$를 봐요. 표준 캐스코드의 입력 밀러 성분은 $2C_{\\mu1}$이므로 이 회로에서는 $5/2$배로 커져요.</p>$$|\\omega_{p,X}|\\simeq 1/[(R_B\\parallel r_{\\pi1})C_X]$$\n$$|\\omega_{p,Y}|\\simeq g_{m2}/C_Y$$\n$$|\\omega_{p,\\mathrm{out}}|\\simeq 1/(R_C C_{\\mathrm{out}})$$\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2021-1_기말-Q1",
      "explanation_id": "p2",
      "subparts": [
        "main"
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "subpart": "main",
          "label": "바이어스 전류",
          "html": "<p> $Y$에서 전류를 나누면 $I_{D2}=I_{D1}-I_{D3}=1\\,\\mathrm{mA}$예요. 장채널 포화식에 각 소자의 폭과 전류를 넣어요.</p>$$g_{m1}=\\sqrt{2\\mu_n C_{ox}(W/L)_1 I_{D1}}=20\\,\\mathrm{mS}$$\n$$g_{m2}=\\sqrt{2\\mu_n C_{ox}(W/L)_2 I_{D2}}=10\\,\\mathrm{mS}$$\n"
        },
        {
          "subpart": "main",
          "label": "내부 노드 이득",
          "html": "<p> $M_3$는 게이트와 소스의 교류 전압이 고정되고 $\\lambda=0$이므로 $Y$에 저주파 전류를 보태지 않아요. 몸체 효과를 무시하면 $Y$의 부하는 $1/g_{m2}$예요.</p>$$A_{XY}=v_Y/v_X=-g_{m1}/g_{m2}=-2$$\n"
        },
        {
          "subpart": "main",
          "label": "밀러 분리 전후의 회로",
          "html": "<figure class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 181\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"왼쪽은 X와 Y 사이에 떠 있는 C_GD1입니다. 오른쪽은 X와 Y에 각각 접지로 연결된 밀러 커패시터입니다.\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\">\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"97\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">분리 전</text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"360\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">분리 후</text>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M24 68 H92.0 M92.0 56 V80 M102.0 56 V80 M102.0 68 H170\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"97\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\">C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">GD1</tspan></text>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"24\" cy=\"68\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p2-pa\" data-node-color=\"blue\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"24\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p2-pa\" data-node-color=\"blue\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">X</tspan></text>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"170\" cy=\"68\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p2-pb\" data-node-color=\"red\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"170\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p2-pb\" data-node-color=\"red\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">Y</tspan></text>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M190 76 H215 m-5 -5 l5 5 -5 5\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M250 68 V96\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M250 96 V106.0 M238 106.0 H262 M238 114.0 H262 M250 114.0 V124\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M250 124 V131\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M240 131 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"250\" cy=\"68\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p2-qa\" data-node-color=\"blue\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"250\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p2-qa\" data-node-color=\"blue\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">X</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"261\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">GD1</tspan></text>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M400 68 V96\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M400 96 V106.0 M388 106.0 H412 M388 114.0 H412 M400 114.0 V124\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M400 124 V131\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M390 131 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"400\" cy=\"68\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p2-qb\" data-node-color=\"red\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"400\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p2-qb\" data-node-color=\"red\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">Y</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"427\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1.5C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">GD1</tspan></text>\n</svg><figcaption>내부 이득 $A_{XY}=-2$를 적용한 밀러 분리.</figcaption></figure>"
        },
        {
          "subpart": "main",
          "label": "밀러 분리",
          "html": "<p> $X$와 $Y$ 사이의 $C_{GD1}$에 밀러 정리를 적용해요.  $M_3$의 드레인에 붙은 $C_{GD3}$·$C_{DB3}$는 $Y$에서 접지로 이어져요.</p>$$C_X=C_{GS1}+3C_{GD1}$$\n$$C_Y=C_{DB1}+C_{GS2}+C_{SB2}+1.5C_{GD1}+C_{GD3}+C_{DB3}$$\n"
        },
        {
          "subpart": "main",
          "label": "노드별 자연응답 회로",
          "html": "<figure class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 550 125\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"노드 X와 노드 Y에서 각각 노드 저항과 접지 기준 커패시턴스가 병렬로 연결된 두 개의 자연응답 회로\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\">\n<g transform=\"translate(107 0)\">\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M36 37 H96\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M36 37 V55.0 l6 3 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 6 3 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M26 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M96 37 V69.0 M84 69.0 H108 M84 77.0 H108 M96 77.0 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M86 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"36\" cy=\"37\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p2-X\" data-node-color=\"blue\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"36\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p2-X\" data-node-color=\"blue\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">X</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"20\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\">R<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">S</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"118\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\">C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">X</tspan></text>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M215 37 H275\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M215 37 V55.0 l6 3 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 6 3 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M205 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M275 37 V69.0 M263 69.0 H287 M263 77.0 H287 M275 77.0 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M265 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"215\" cy=\"37\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p2-Y\" data-node-color=\"red\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"215\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p2-Y\" data-node-color=\"red\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">Y</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"199\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\">1/g<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">m2</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"297\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\">C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">Y</tspan></text>\n</g>\n</svg><figcaption>입력원과 바이어스 전압을 영으로 둔 두 노드의 RC 경로예요.</figcaption></figure>"
        }
      ],
      "answers": [
        {
          "subpart": "main",
          "html": "<p>입력원을 영으로 두면 $R_X=R_S=100\\,\\Omega$이고 $R_Y=1/g_{m2}=100\\,\\Omega$예요. 노드별 극점의 크기는 rad/s 단위예요.</p>$$|\\omega_{p,X}|\\simeq 1/(100\\,\\Omega\\, C_X)$$\n$$|\\omega_{p,Y}|\\simeq 1/(100\\,\\Omega\\, C_Y)$$\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "E11.27",
      "explanation_id": "p3",
      "subparts": [
        "main"
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "subpart": "main",
          "label": "반회로의 내부 이득",
          "html": "<p>대칭 회로에 반대 부호의 입력을 주면 꼬리 전압 변화가 상쇄돼요.  $M_1$ 게이트에서  $M_3$ 소스까지는 공통 소스 단이 $1/g_{m3}$를 구동해요. 여기서는 $r_o$와 몸체 효과를 무시해요.</p>$$A_{XY}=v_Y/v_X=-g_{m1}/g_{m3}$$\n"
        },
        {
          "subpart": "main",
          "label": "밀러 분리 전후의 회로",
          "html": "<figure class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 181\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"왼쪽은 X와 Y 사이에 떠 있는 C_GD1입니다. 오른쪽은 X와 Y에 각각 접지로 연결된 밀러 커패시터입니다.\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\">\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"97\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">분리 전</text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"360\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">분리 후</text>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M24 68 H92.0 M92.0 56 V80 M102.0 56 V80 M102.0 68 H170\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"97\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\">C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">GD1</tspan></text>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"24\" cy=\"68\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p3-pa\" data-node-color=\"blue\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"24\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p3-pa\" data-node-color=\"blue\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">X</tspan></text>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"170\" cy=\"68\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p3-pb\" data-node-color=\"red\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"170\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p3-pb\" data-node-color=\"red\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">Y</tspan></text>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M190 76 H215 m-5 -5 l5 5 -5 5\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M250 68 V96\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M250 96 V106.0 M238 106.0 H262 M238 114.0 H262 M250 114.0 V124\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M250 124 V131\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M240 131 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"250\" cy=\"68\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p3-qa\" data-node-color=\"blue\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"250\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p3-qa\" data-node-color=\"blue\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">X</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"261\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(1 + g<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">m1</tspan>/g<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">m3</tspan>)C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">GD1</tspan></text>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M400 68 V96\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M400 96 V106.0 M388 106.0 H412 M388 114.0 H412 M400 114.0 V124\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M400 124 V131\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M390 131 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"400\" cy=\"68\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p3-qb\" data-node-color=\"red\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"400\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p3-qb\" data-node-color=\"red\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">Y</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"427\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(1 + g<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">m3</tspan>/g<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">m1</tspan>)C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">GD1</tspan></text>\n</svg><figcaption>차동 반회로의 $A_{XY}=-g_{m1}/g_{m3}$로 분리한 밀러 성분이에요.</figcaption></figure>"
        },
        {
          "subpart": "main",
          "label": "각 노드의 커패시턴스",
          "html": "<p>· 사이의 $C_{GD1}$에 밀러 정리를 적용해요.  출력에서는 $M_3$의 게이트와 몸체가 모두 AC 접지예요.</p>$$C_X=C_{GS1}+(1-A_{XY})C_{GD1}$$\n$$C_Y=C_{DB1}+C_{GS3}+C_{SB3}+(1-1/A_{XY})C_{GD1}$$\n$$C_{\\mathrm{out}}=C_{DB3}+C_{GD3}$$\n"
        },
        {
          "subpart": "main",
          "label": "노드별 자연응답 회로",
          "html": "<figure class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 505 125\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"입력 X, 중간 Y, 출력에서 각각 노드 저항과 접지 기준 커패시턴스가 병렬로 연결된 세 개의 자연응답 회로\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\">\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M36 37 H96\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M36 37 V55.0 l6 3 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 6 3 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M26 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M96 37 V69.0 M84 69.0 H108 M84 77.0 H108 M96 77.0 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M86 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"36\" cy=\"37\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p3-X\" data-node-color=\"blue\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"36\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p3-X\" data-node-color=\"blue\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">X</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"20\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\">R<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">S</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"118\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\">C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">X</tspan></text>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M215 37 H275\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M215 37 V55.0 l6 3 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 6 3 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M205 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M275 37 V69.0 M263 69.0 H287 M263 77.0 H287 M275 77.0 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M265 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"215\" cy=\"37\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p3-Y\" data-node-color=\"red\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"215\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p3-Y\" data-node-color=\"red\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">Y</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"199\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\">1/g<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">m3</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"297\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\">C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">Y</tspan></text>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M372 37 H432\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M372 37 V55.0 l6 3 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 6 3 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M362 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M432 37 V69.0 M420 69.0 H444 M420 77.0 H444 M432 77.0 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M422 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"372\" cy=\"37\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p3-out\" data-node-color=\"blue\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"372\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p3-out\" data-node-color=\"blue\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">out</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"356\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\">R<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">D</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"454\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\">C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">out</tspan></text>\n</svg><figcaption>꼬리 가상 접지를 유지하고 입력원을 영으로 둔 반회로의 세 RC 경로예요.</figcaption></figure>"
        }
      ],
      "answers": [
        {
          "subpart": "main",
          "html": "<p>반회로의 입력원을 영으로 두면 각 커패시턴스에서 보이는 저항은 차례로 $R_S$, $1/g_{m3}$, $R_D$예요. 따라서 차동 응답의 극점 크기(rad/s)는 다음과 같아요.</p>$$|\\omega_{p,X}|\\simeq 1/(R_S C_X)$$\n$$|\\omega_{p,Y}|\\simeq g_{m3}/C_Y$$\n$$|\\omega_{p,\\mathrm{out}}|\\simeq 1/(R_D C_{\\mathrm{out}})$$\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2023-1_기말-Q1",
      "explanation_id": "p4",
      "subparts": [
        "1",
        "2"
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "subpart": "1",
          "label": "Q1 원 회로의 내부 이득",
          "html": "<p> $A$에서 보면 $M_2$와 $M_3$의 소스가 모두 AC 접지 쪽의 경로를 만들어요. $\\lambda=0$이고 몸체 효과를 무시하면 두 입력 저항은 병렬이에요.</p>$$R_A=(1/g_{m2})\\parallel(1/g_{m3})=1/(g_{m2}+g_{m3})$$\n$$A_{XA}=v_A/v_X=-g_{m1}R_A$$\n"
        },
        {
          "subpart": "1",
          "label": "밀러 분리 전후의 회로",
          "html": "<figure class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 181\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"왼쪽은 X와 A 사이에 떠 있는 C_GD1입니다. 오른쪽은 X와 A에 각각 접지로 연결된 밀러 커패시터입니다.\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\">\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"97\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">분리 전</text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"360\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">분리 후</text>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M24 68 H92.0 M92.0 56 V80 M102.0 56 V80 M102.0 68 H170\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"97\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\">C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">GD1</tspan></text>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"24\" cy=\"68\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p4a-pa\" data-node-color=\"blue\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"24\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p4a-pa\" data-node-color=\"blue\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">X</tspan></text>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"170\" cy=\"68\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p4a-pb\" data-node-color=\"red\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"170\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p4a-pb\" data-node-color=\"red\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">A</tspan></text>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M190 76 H215 m-5 -5 l5 5 -5 5\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M250 68 V96\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M250 96 V106.0 M238 106.0 H262 M238 114.0 H262 M250 114.0 V124\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M250 124 V131\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M240 131 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"250\" cy=\"68\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p4a-qa\" data-node-color=\"blue\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"250\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p4a-qa\" data-node-color=\"blue\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">X</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"261\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(1 + g<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">m1</tspan>R<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">A</tspan>)C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">GD1</tspan></text>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M400 68 V96\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M400 96 V106.0 M388 106.0 H412 M388 114.0 H412 M400 114.0 V124\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M400 124 V131\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M390 131 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"400\" cy=\"68\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p4a-qb\" data-node-color=\"red\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"400\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p4a-qb\" data-node-color=\"red\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">A</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"427\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(1 + 1/(g<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">m1</tspan>R<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">A</tspan>))C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">GD1</tspan></text>\n</svg><figcaption>(1) $A_{XA}=-g_{m1}R_A$이므로 내부 노드 쪽에는 역수 배율이 들어가요.</figcaption></figure>"
        },
        {
          "subpart": "1",
          "label": "밀러 분리",
          "html": "<p>$C_{GD1}$만 $X$와 $A$를 가로질러요. 출력의 다이오드 접속 $M_4$에서는 게이트와 드레인이 같아 $C_{GD4}$가 빠져요.</p>$$C_{in}=C_{GS1}+(1-A_{XA})C_{GD1}$$\n$$C_A=C_{DB1}+C_{GS2}+C_{SB2}+C_{GS3}+C_{SB3}+(1-1/A_{XA})C_{GD1}$$\n$$C_{out}=C_{GD2}+C_{DB2}+C_{GS4}+C_{DB4}$$\n"
        },
        {
          "subpart": "1",
          "label": "노드별 자연응답 회로",
          "html": "<figure class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 579 125\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"입력 X, 중간 A, 출력에서 각각 노드 저항과 접지 기준 커패시턴스가 병렬로 연결된 세 개의 자연응답 회로\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\">\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M36 37 H96\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M36 37 V55.0 l6 3 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 6 3 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M26 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M96 37 V69.0 M84 69.0 H108 M84 77.0 H108 M96 77.0 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M86 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"36\" cy=\"37\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p4a-X\" data-node-color=\"blue\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"36\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p4a-X\" data-node-color=\"blue\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">X</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"20\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\">R<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">G</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"118\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\">C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">in</tspan></text>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M267 37 H327\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M267 37 V55.0 l6 3 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 6 3 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M257 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M327 37 V69.0 M315 69.0 H339 M315 77.0 H339 M327 77.0 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M317 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"267\" cy=\"37\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p4a-A\" data-node-color=\"red\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"267\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p4a-A\" data-node-color=\"red\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">A</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"251\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\">1/(g<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">m2</tspan>+g<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">m3</tspan>)</text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"349\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\">C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">A</tspan></text>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M446 37 H506\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M446 37 V55.0 l6 3 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 12 6 -12 6 6 3 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M436 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M506 37 V69.0 M494 69.0 H518 M494 77.0 H518 M506 77.0 V109\"/>\n<path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M496 109 h20 m-16 5 h12 m-8 5 h4\"/>\n<circle class=\"fig-dot\" cx=\"446\" cy=\"37\" r=\"3.5\" data-node-id=\"p4a-out\" data-node-color=\"blue\"/>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"446\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-node-id=\"p4a-out\" data-node-color=\"blue\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">out</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"430\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\">1/g<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">m4</tspan></text>\n<text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"528\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\">C<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">out</tspan></text>\n</svg><figcaption>(1) 각 노드의 RC 경로. 가운데 저항은 $R_A=1/(g_{m2}+g_{m3})$예요.</figcaption></figure>"
